# Locally-built REVEL lookup data (see scripts/download_revel.sh). Too
# large for a git repo (the bgzipped index alone exceeds GitHub's 100MB
# per-file limit) — small test fixtures live in tests/fixtures/revel/
# instead. Scoped to the REVEL artifacts specifically, not all of data/,
# since other data/ subdirectories (e.g. data/clingen/) bundle real,
# git-sized reference datasets directly.
data/revel_v1.3_all_chromosomes.tsv.gz
data/revel_v1.3_all_chromosomes.tsv.gz.tbi

# Commercial and regulatory material kept locally, deliberately not published:
# AlleleIQ exec summaries / IUS / lab presentations are commercially sensitive,
# and the Innoscot regulatory-pathway guidance is a third-party copyrighted PDF.
Updated docs/
innoscotguidanceontheregulatorypathway/
